nce</span>","-                <span class=\"form-card__subtitle\">Harmonize directional principles with functional structural geometry</span>","-              </div>","-            </legend>","-","-            <div class=\"stance-read\">","-              <div class=\"stance-header\">","-                <span class=\"stance-badge\" id=\"stance-name\"><span class=\"stance-spark\">✦</span> Balanced</span>","-              </div>","-              <p class=\"stance-desc\" id=\"stance-note\">Classical Vastu principles and modern structural science carry equal weight.</p>","-            </div>","-","-            <div class=\"slider-container\">","-              <input type=\"range\" class=\"stance stance--claude\" name=\"vastu_slider\" id=\"stance\" min=\"0\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\"","-                     aria-label=\"Vastu stance from modern to orthodox\">","-              <div class=\"stance-scale\" id=\"stance-scale\" aria-hidden=\"true\">","-                <span data-val=\"0\">Modern</span>","-                <span data-val=\"1\">Advisory</span>","-                <span data-val=\"2\" class=\"is-active\">Balanced</span>","-                <span data-val=\"3\">Strict</span>","-                <span data-val=\"4\">Orthodox</span>","-              </div>","-            </div>","-          </fieldset>","-","-          <!-- Card 5: Architectural Style -->","-          <fieldset class=\"form-card\">","-            <legend class=\"form-card__head\">","-              <div class=\"form-card__icon-badge\">","-                <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polygon points=\"12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2\"></polygon><polyline points=\"2 17 12 22 22 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"2 12 12 17 22 12\"></polyline></svg>","-              </div>","-              <div>","-                <span class=\"form-card__title\">Architectural Style</span>","-                <span class=\"form-card__subtitle\"