eak</span>","-            </div>","-          </fieldset>","-","+      <section class=\"spec__group\" aria-labelledby=\"g-style\">","+        <h2 class=\"spec__h\" id=\"g-style\">Style</h2>","+        <div class=\"row\">","+          <label class=\"row__k\" for=\"inp-styles\">Language</label>","+          <div class=\"row__v\">","+            <select name=\"styles\" id=\"inp-styles\">","+              <option value=\"tropical_modern\" selected>Tropical modern</option>","+              <option value=\"contemporary\">Contemporary minimal</option>","+              <option value=\"biophilic\">Biophilic</option>","+              <option value=\"kerala_vernacular\">Kerala vernacular</option>","+              <option value=\"chettinad\">Chettinad heritage</option>","+              <option value=\"modern_minimal\">Modern minimalist</option>","+              <option value=\"japandi\">Japandi</option>","+              <option value=\"industrial\">Industrial loft</option>","+              <option value=\"scandinavian\">Scandinavian</option>","+            </select>","+          </div>","         </div>","+      </section>"," ","+      <div class=\"go\">","+        <p class=\"go__sum\" id=\"sum-line\">216 m² plot · 3 bedrooms · ₹65 lakh · Vastu balanced</p>","+        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--cream btn--go\" id=\"convene\">","+          <span class=\"convene__title-text\">Convene the studio</span>","+          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg>","+        </button>","+        <p class=\"go__fine\" id=\"convene-sub\">13 specialists · 3 schemes · costs nothing to run</p>","       </div>","+    </form>"," ","-      <!-- ── LIVE ARCHITECTURAL HUD SUMMARY BAR ── -->","-      <div class=\"studio-hud studio-hud--bottom\" id=\"studio-hud\">","-        <div class=\"hud-item\" title=\"Calculated Ground Footprint\">","-          <span class=\"hud-label\">Site Footprint</span>","-          <span class=\"hud-val\" id=\"p