{"parentUuid":"dc6e8200-1a30-4193-9f6d-04da88133cae","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfsFfqvau3hc9FFuvVYBt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I rebuilt the whole studio from scratch in the Studio Rabbit look, keeping only the 3D figures and the 3D model viewer. It's committed locally as `308a4e8` and not pushed. The 252 backend tests pass, and I checked brief, run and review in the browser on desktop and phone.\n\n- **Look:** warm black and cream, with film grain over everything. Big headings use Studio Rabbit's own font, set in capitals with an italic line beside them; everything you click uses their second font. Sections are split by thin lines instead of boxes. Red appears only when something fails.\n- **Brief:** it opens straight on the brief. On the left, a large headline is your house (\"A home on 15 × 18 m, facing east, three bedrooms, two storeys\") over a to-scale drawing of the plot. Both redraw as you type, showing setbacks, which side the road is on, the floors and the dimensions. On the right, the inputs are laid out as a specification sheet:\n  - number fields with − and + buttons\n  - a compass for the road side\n  - pill toggles for extra rooms\n  - a five-step Vastu selector\n  - a \"Convene the studio\" button that stays at the bottom of the screen\n- **Run:** a full-screen 3D board with the current stage written large at the bottom left, the way their site writes its section titles (\"Stage 4 of 9\", then \"REVIEW\", then the engine's message). Scores are in a column on the right, and the progress line runs along the bottom edge.\n- **Review:** the drawing on the left, and one panel on the right with the score, four key stats (estimate, area, Vastu, findings) and the committee. Every tab (Vastu, Cost, Report and the rest) uses the same type and lines.\n- **Drawings and airflow:** the drawings the server renders are now warm black and cream instead of navy. The airflow diagram I still owed you is redone: still air is dark, moving air glows cream, and a sealed room shows in red. The rainbow colours and the cramped header are gone.\n- **Removed:** the old intro animation, the star field, the compass dial and the two old stylesheets.\n\nThe design guidelines file (`DESIGN.md`) now describes this new look.\n\nThe design skill normally finishes with a review by a separate agent. I skipped that because of your no-subagents rule. Say the word if you want it run."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":794,"cache_read_input_tokens":570973,"output_tokens":847,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":82},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":794,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":847,"cache_read_input_tokens":570973,"cache_creation_input_tokens":794,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":794},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfsFfqYFpXJnfEYsccFhA","attributionSkill":"impeccable","attributionMcpServer":"Claude Browser","attributionMcpTool":"resize_window","type":"assistant","uuid":"bbfa82fd-3958-4b4b-912a-18b71f376370","timestamp":"2026-10-09T19:57:39.507Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"F:\\Users\\shrey\\Desktop\\AI Project\\backend","sessionId":"fd077be5-cd09-4d91-beb4-30df27c1398e","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"fluttering-mapping-sloth"}
