{"parentUuid":"4b97f67c-df72-4574-a623-f807545976bc","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14976730 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"abce7dd8-7d0e-4207-9936-b4fe2e64378d","timestamp":"2026-10-09T21:09:57.608Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14976730 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"F:\\Users\\shrey\\Desktop\\AI Project\\backend","sessionId":"fd077be5-cd09-4d91-beb4-30df27c1398e","version":"2.1.293","gitBranch":"main","slug":"fluttering-mapping-sloth"}
{"parentUuid":"abce7dd8-7d0e-4207-9936-b4fe2e64378d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfsMCNGsyxzXfhRHpQnCD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The redesign is on GitHub: `main` is now `63f2e90` at https://github.com/shreyasmandem/Atri-Arch. GitHub had 19 newer commits from someone else, so I merged them in first and pushed normally. Nothing was overwritten.\n\n- **Backend:** all of their backend work came in unchanged (the Vastu calibration package and its status endpoint, plus their metrics and airflow-solver changes).\n- **Airflow diagram:** I kept their bigger version, with room cards, inlet arrows, prevailing wind and the room summary, and re-coloured its 25 hard-coded colours to the warm studio palette.\n- **Frontend:** the Studio Rabbit rebuild stays. I ported one feature from their version: pan and zoom on drawings. Scroll zooms toward the pointer, drag pans, double-click zooms in or back out, and there are − / % / + buttons where clicking the % resets the fit.\n- **Left out:** their star-field and gold \"astro\" animations and their `studio.css`. They belong to the look we replaced.\n\nAll 274 backend tests pass on the merged code: our 252 plus their 22 calibration tests. In the browser, the merged airflow sheet renders in the new palette and the zoom buttons work.\n\nI didn't commit one local file, `.claude/launch.json`. It holds the preview-server settings, including the entry I added for the Studio Rabbit reference site."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":245,"cache_read_input_tokens":612966,"output_tokens":471,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":245,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_token