{"parentUuid":"39f6f190-5375-4ee8-9179-ff1acb39b6fc","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14998391 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"0e6e3838-b479-4293-aec0-e1cb1e8c3d68","timestamp":"2026-10-10T06:52:44.010Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14998391 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"F:\\Users\\shrey\\Desktop\\AI Project\\backend","sessionId":"fd077be5-cd09-4d91-beb4-30df27c1398e","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"main","slug":"fluttering-mapping-sloth"}
{"parentUuid":"0e6e3838-b479-4293-aec0-e1cb1e8c3d68","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cft7drxMsYGNUV6gknbT7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The figures now keep pace with the engine, so there's little left to catch up once the result arrives. Committed locally as `cab118d`, not pushed.\n\n- **Faster by default:** normal drawing speed goes from 1.7 to 2.2 m/s.\n- **Matched to the engine:** a few times a second, the team's speed is set to whatever finishes the drawing when the engine is estimated to finish. That estimate comes from the engine's progress and the time elapsed. Speed changes smoothly between 1× and 9×. In the live check it climbed from 2.7× to 5.9× as the finish got closer; that was before I raised the cap from 6× to 9×, so the new cap hasn't been run yet.\n- **Shorter end:** whatever is left when the result arrives is now drawn in about 2.5 seconds instead of 5. It still draws every line and raises every wall; the safety cap is now 6 seconds.\n\nOne case still costs a short final sprint: the house the team draws is the scheme leading at the moment, and a late committee decision can switch to another one. In the check run the winner changed to Scheme C right at the end. All of C's 16 rooms were then drawn during the catch-up, which hit the 14× ceiling, so that run's ending was faster than the 2.5 seconds above.\n\nThe preview browser here only runs part of the animation frames, so watch one run in your own browser to judge how it looks at full speed. Should I push this to GitHub?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1299,"cache_read_input_tokens":637404,"output_tokens":471,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1299,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":471,"cache_read_input_tokens":637404,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1299,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1299},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cft7dre1KRmiK7ozxL8kR","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"58839e9d-293b-4e13-ac6b-3151f9e06f39","timestamp":"2026-10-10T06:52:50.055Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"F:\\Users\\shrey\\Desktop\\AI Project\\backend","sessionId":"fd077be5-cd09-4d91-beb4-30df27c1398e","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"main","slug":"fluttering-mapping-sloth"}
