{"parentUuid":"01d9aaf6-26c9-4bbe-b84e-481782c0287b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CftDoWYzat7cQ3Qbmz4Be","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 13-check audit of 32 plans found zero clean ones; I've sent every issue to the plan agent with a target of at least 26 of 32 clean:\n\n- **Rooms too small to furnish:** 29 plans, e.g. a 1.4 × 3.9 m bathroom.\n- **Slot-shaped rooms:** 23 plans, e.g. a 2.6:1 living room.\n- **Too much corridor:** 22 plans.\n- **Stairs that don't stack between floors:** 20 plans.\n- **Footprint far smaller than the plot allows:** 15 plans.\n- **Upper-floor walls not over lower-floor walls:** 14 plans; in one example only 44% of the upper walls had support below.\n- **Corridors as room-sized blobs:** 12 plans.\n- **Upper bathroom over a kitchen, dining room or puja:** 11 plans.\n- **Bedrooms with 3 doors:** 7 plans.\n- **Rare:** kitchen, dining and foyer adjacency problems, and a puja beside a toilet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":160,"cache_read_input_tokens":734779,"output_tokens":355,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":160,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":355,"cache_read_input_tokens":734779,"cache_creation_input_tokens":160,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":160},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CftDoWAvjnLq3u41kTMov","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"079e165b-d8bb-4fcf-ba3f-d966eeb369ca","timestamp":"2026-10-10T08:13:39.830Z","advisorM