{"parentUuid":"c96e882b-efe3-4945-b202-1b677f6c95cd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cde90b88-60f3-4a8e-aba6-b51e470ae5ea","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KvCVmo59hwoDjw4v4gtk8G","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"FAQs\\nWhen and where is neatHack?\\n01\\nCan I build with a team?\\n02\\nWhat can I build beforehand?\\n03\\nHow many tracks are there?\\n04\\nDo I have to use a partner technology?\\n05\\nWhat do I need to submit?\\n06\\nHow are projects judged?\\n07\\nHow does the community winner work?\\n08\\nWhat are the conduct rules?\\n09\\nDoes the AWS allowance cover AI model APIs?\\n10\\nWhere can I get help and credits?\\n11\\n\\nJoin neatlogs.com/discord for official neatHack communication. AWS credits go to the first 350 teams to complete web check-in. Crustdata gives 5,000 credits to everyone participating. Dodo Payments credits are for the top three winners only: $5,000 for first, $3,000 for second and $1,000 for third. Each winner gets 3 months of neatlogs Pro (worth $1500). Access and redemption details will be published with the resources. Workshops and office hours run on both days.\"\n\n(captured at origin https://neatlogs.com)"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: seed\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId seed: \"neatHack — AI agent hackathon | neatlogs\" (\"https://neatlogs.com/hackathon\")"}]}]},"uuid":"35bf4a17-d0a2-4f64-95fe-0824a7e9608d","timestamp":"2026-10-10T09:15:36.878Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"\"FAQs\\nWhen and where is neatHack?\\n01\\nCan I build with a team?\\n02\\nWhat can I build beforehand?\\n03\\nHow many tracks are there?\\n04\\nDo I have to use a partner technology?\\n05\\nWhat do I need to submit?\\n06\\nHow are projects judged?\\n07\\nHow does the community winner work?\\n08\\nWhat are the conduct rules?\\n09\\nDoes the AWS allowance cover AI model APIs?\\n10\\nWhere can I get help and credits?\\n11\\n\\nJoin neatlogs.com/discord for